678/status/1623626221144907776"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-08T12:23:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1623296578042863617"],"id":"1623296578042863617","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":25527,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这是在练什么? https://t.co/nG3WNJ89C1","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1623296578042863617"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-08T08:27:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1623236986533470208"],"id":"1623236986533470208","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":28117,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又被妹子抓来健身了... https://t.co/y4MnWjIBhV","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1623236986533470208"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-08T02:06:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1623141147911819268"],"id":"1623141147911819268","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":65867,"like_count":90,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":9},"text":"日本有一家专门做情侣淫趴的店，单男的不让进，单女的也不让进，仅限于一男一女才能进。进门还要看年纪看颜值，岁数大的长得差的直接禁止入内。\n经常有妹子来日本找我玩想要刺激点活动的时候，我就会带着她们去这家店。应该是我在日本这么多年，见到过的男女颜值质量最高的店了。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1623141147911819268"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-07T12:22:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1622933880620859392"],"id":"1622933880620859392","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":35654,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"来一个SM的绳缚会和调教聚会 https://t.co/wLNM3AIfrF","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1622933880620859392"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-02-07T09:28:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1622889947647868929"],"id":"1622889947647868929","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22903,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实推特也可以发我写的那些内容，但实在是互动太低让人没有发布的欲望...\n与人交流或是闷头赚钱我总得挑一样吧...结果现在付费会员圈子里的互动率比推特里都高，谁还愿意在推特发东西??","url":"htt